vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:5200
}

docs {
  Creates or updates the general section of an application. Accepts multipart/form-data
  because optional document files (national ID, passport, visa, refugee) can be uploaded alongside.
  
  Field notes:
  - `appRefNo`: use an existing ref no to update, or a new one to create.
  - `enquiryGuid` (optional): links the application to an existing enquiry.
  - `countryGuid` replaces old `intCountry` + `countryCode` fields.
  - `feeHdGuid` replaces old `intFee` field.
  - `batchTimeGuid` replaces old `intBatchTime` field.
  - `batchGuid` replaces old `intBatch` field.
  - `spCountryGuid` replaces old `spCountryCode` field.
  - `refugee`: 1 = refugee student, 0 = not. When 1, `refugeeId` and `refugeeFile` apply.
  
  Success (200): data = SaveGeneralResponseDto (appRefNo, intApplication).
  Failure: 400 `validation_error`.
}
